msgid "Markdown (MyST)"
msgstr "Markdown (MyST)"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:127
#: e4811a3bbbbf466a82887bb989741b23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use MyST-flavored Markdown. **Never nest `` ``` `` fences inside `` "
"```{admonition} ``** — that breaks zh_CN rendering. Use colon fences "
"(`:::`) when an admonition must contain a code block, and wrap examples "
"of fences in a 4-backtick outer fence:"
msgstr ""
"使用 MyST 风格的 Markdown。**切勿在 `` ```{admonition} `` 内部嵌套 `` ``` `` "
"围栏**——这会破坏 zh_CN 渲染。当提示框需要包含代码块时，请使用冒号围栏（`:::`）；展示围栏语法的示例请用 4 个反引号作为外层围栏："

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:129
#: 314861d4107d4d68b5f1e3933cca12f0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# Heading\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph text.\n"
"\n"
"## Subheading\n"
"\n"
"- List item\n"
"- Another item\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"code block\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
":::{admonition} Note\n"
":class: tip\n"
"\n"
"Admonition content.\n"
":::\n"
msgstr ""
"# Heading\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph text.\n"
"\n"
"## Subheading\n"
"\n"
"- List item\n"
"- Another item\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"code block\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
":::{admonition} Note\n"
":class: tip\n"
"\n"
"Admonition content.\n"
":::\n"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:150
#: 62ff7eaa195245ec82660f2461ad686b
msgid "Code Blocks"
msgstr "代码块"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:152
#: ca66359b09c84eb2b9df77a76c47d707
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use fenced code blocks with a language tag (or `{code-block} none` for "
"trees). Unlabeled `` ``` `` fences become RST `::` and zh_CN HTML can "
"leak a bare `::`. Keep the matching `.po` `msgstr` **identical** to "
"`msgid` for every code or tree block: a translated comment, extra line, "
"or dropped line is re-parsed as RST `::`, and MyST `colon_fence` then "
"drops the real block."
msgstr ""
"代码块要带语言标记（目录树用 `{code-block} none`）。无语言标记的 `` ``` `` 围栏会变成 RST 的 "
"`::`，zh_CN HTML 可能漏出裸的 `::`。每个代码/目录树块的 `.po` `msgstr` 必须与 `msgid` "
"**完全一致**：翻译了注释、多一行或少一行，都会被再解析成 RST `::`，然后 MyST `colon_fence` 丢掉真正的代码块。"

