#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:233
#: 43569f910c1c46c8adc5499971d223f6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`source/_vendored/` holds **pinned commit** copies of public upstream "
"Markdown so Sphinx can `{include}` a short slice. This site vendors "
"**README.md** files only: `ros2_robot_interface`, plus "
"`basic_joint_controller` and `adaptive_gripper_controller` from "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control). "
"[ros2_robot_interface API_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) stays a GitHub link "
"and is not copied into `_vendored/`."
msgstr ""
"`source/_vendored/` 存放公开上游 Markdown 的**钉选提交**副本，供 Sphinx `{include}` "
"一小段。本站只 vendoring **README.md**：`ros2_robot_interface`，以及 "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) 里的"
" `basic_joint_controller` 与 "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller`。[ros2_robot_interface "
"API_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ros2_robot_interface/blob/main/API_REFERENCE.md) 保持 GitHub 链接，不复制进 "
"`_vendored/`。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:235
#: 7294bbd233ab4427a80929b56c338ffd
msgid ""
"Pins: `source/_vendored/SOURCES.json` (`repo`, `path`, full commit `sha`,"
" `dest`)."
msgstr "钉选：`source/_vendored/SOURCES.json`（`repo`、`path`、完整提交 `sha`、`dest`）。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:237
#: 69b0ac187b5d418eac38c0a52358236a
msgid ""
"# Re-fetch every pin in SOURCES.json\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --sync\n"
"make vendor-upstream\n"
"\n"
"# Verify header SHA / sha256 (CI; no network)\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --check\n"
"make vendor-check\n"
"\n"
"# Move one pin to latest main, or to a SHA\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump ros2_robot_interface\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump basic_joint_controller --sha"
" <full-sha>\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump adaptive_gripper_controller "
"--sha <full-sha>\n"
msgstr ""
"# Re-fetch every pin in SOURCES.json\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --sync\n"
"make vendor-upstream\n"
"\n"
"# Verify header SHA / sha256 (CI; no network)\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --check\n"
"make vendor-check\n"
"\n"
"# Move one pin to latest main, or to a SHA\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump ros2_robot_interface\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump basic_joint_controller --sha"
" <full-sha>\n"
"python3 scripts/vendor_upstream_md.py --bump adaptive_gripper_controller "
"--sha <full-sha>\n"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:252
#: 78895fd8850142f3b960d4145070a4b9
msgid ""
"Commit `SOURCES.json` and the vendored markdown together. Relative / "
"private images are stripped on fetch so the HTML build does not depend on"
" missing files."
msgstr ""
"把 `SOURCES.json` 与 vendored markdown 一起提交。抓取时会去掉相对 / 私有图片，避免 HTML "
"构建依赖缺失文件。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:254
#: 82363998f5a144eba812fcb6acfb3f89
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"After a bump, recompute `{include}` **`:start-line:` / `:end-line:`** on "
"the pages that slice a vendored README "
"([basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md),"
" [gripper "
"plugins](../4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md), "
"[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md))."
" Line numbers are 1-based. Set `:end-line:` to the last line of the slice"
" — typically the blank line or `---` **before** the next heading — then "
"rebuild and confirm that heading is not in the HTML."
msgstr ""
"bump 之后，重算切了 vendored README 的页面上 `{include}` 的 **`:start-line:` / "
"`:end-line:`**（[basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)、[夹爪插件](../4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md)、[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)）。行号从 1 起。把 `:end-line:` 设为切片的最后一行——通常是下一节标题**之前**的空行或 `---`——然后重新构建，确认那个标题没有出现在 HTML 里。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:256
#: 8a95731bd590474ab9fc8da915cb9242
msgid ""
"Do **not** cut a slice with `:end-before:` / `:start-after:` against "
"heading text. Those options truncate **mid-line**, so a marker such as "
"`Demo Launch` against `## 7. Demo Launch` leaves `## 7.` as an empty-ish "
"heading. You also cannot put `#` in those option values — Docutils treats"
" `#` as a comment."
msgstr ""
"**不要**用标题文字做 `:end-before:` / `:start-after:` 来切片段。这两个选项会在**行中途**截断，因此用 "
"`Demo Launch` 去截 `## 7. Demo Launch` 会留下 `## 7.`，变成空荡荡的标题。这些选项值里也不能写 `#`"
" —— Docutils 把 `#` 当注释。"

#: ../../source/5-developer/2-docs_build.md:258
#: 57a911aa30ce447d8ffca7a1c704ed18
msgid ""
"`conf.py` lists `_vendored/` in `exclude_patterns` so the copy is not a "
"sidebar page."
msgstr "`conf.py` 把 `_vendored/` 列入 `exclude_patterns`，因此这份副本不会成为侧边栏页面。"

